// Cost-control queries against the workspace Usage table (system-generated
// ingestion telemetry — not part of the DCR streams, always present).
//
// 1. What is each data type costing us? Quantity is in meter units; convert
//    against the Log Analytics per-GB price on the Azure Monitor pricing
//    page for your currency/region before quoting numbers.
Usage
| where TimeGenerated > ago(30d)
| summarize Quantity = round(sum(Quantity), 2) by DataType
| order by Quantity desc

// 2. Ingestion trend — spot the runaway before the daily quota stops it.
Usage
| where TimeGenerated > ago(14d)
| summarize Daily = round(sum(Quantity), 2) by bin(TimeGenerated, 1d)
| render timechart

// 3. Who is noisy? Syslog volume by host and facility.
Syslog
| where TimeGenerated > ago(7d)
| summarize Records = count() by Computer, Facility
| order by Records desc
| take 20
